      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is a 20-day Preliminary Notice the same as a mechanics lien?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. The 20-day Preliminary Notice (§8200) is a prerequisite for filing a lien — it must be served within 20 days of starting work. The mechanics lien (§8410) is filed later if payment is not received."
      }
